<title>NETHERLANDS: Stet joins AT&amp;T-Unisource.</title>
<headline>Stet joins AT&amp;T-Unisource.</headline>
<dateline>HOOFDDORP, Netherlands 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisource said on Wednesday Italian telecoms firms Stet and Telecom Italia would join its AT&amp;T-Unisource telecoms venture in Europe.</p>
<p>Unisource is a telecoms joint venture grouping Dutch PTT, Telia of Sweden and Swiss Telecom PTT. AT&amp;T Unisource is its 60-40 pct joint venture with AT&amp;T Corp of the U.S.</p>
</text>
